div><div class="news-items__main l-container"><main class="news-items__main--wrapper"><article class="article-post" data-source-models="2" data-v-9f7e13a7><header class="article__header grid grid-flow-row em:gap-5" data-v-9f7e13a7><h1 class="article-title" data-v-9f7e13a7>彰化五連霸綠營女將不選了　賴清美宣布接班人</h1><div class="flex flex-col gap-6" data-v-9f7e13a7><div class="grid em:gap-6 place-content-start grid-flow-col auto-cols-max items-center text-lg md:text-xs md:hidden" data-v-9f7e13a7><div class="base-fontsize-picker flex" data-v-9f7e13a7><!--[--><button style="font-size:12px;" class="item leading-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm font-medium">小</button><button style="font-size:16px;" class="active item leading-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm font-medium">中</button><button style="font-size:20px;" class="item leading-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-sm font-medium">大</button><!--]--></div><!--[--><div class="base-action-button text-xl md:ml-5" data-v-9f7e13a7><!--[--><button type="button" class="flex items-center justify-center" aria-pressed="false"><div class="relative text-lg grid grid-flow-col gap-1 items-center"><img width="24" height="24" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width=&#39;24&#39;%20height=&#39;24&#39;%20viewBox=&#39;0%200%2024%2024&#39;%20fill=&#39;none&#39;%20xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39;%3e%3cpath%20d=&#39;M6.59887%209.92871H3V19.563H6.59887V9.92871Z&#39;%20stroke=&#39;%230D1C2E&#39;%20stroke-width=&#39;1.5&#39;/%3e%3cpath%20d=&#39;M8.34943%209.29328V19.5662H17.9838L21.0001%2012.2592V9.66576H13.8023L14.6762%206.75306V4.58254L13.8556%204H13.1666L8.34943%209.29328Z&#39;%20stroke=&#39;%230D1C2E&#39;%20stroke-width=&#39;1.5&#39;/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="" aria-hidden="true"><!----><!--[--><!--]--></div></button><!--]--></div><span></span><!--]--><!--[--><div class="base-action-button md:ml-5" data-v-9f7e13a7><!--[--><button type="button" class="base-action-collect flex items-center justify-center" aria-pressed="false"><div class="relative text-lg grid grid-flow-col gap-1 items-center"><span class="text-current material-icons-round block icon">bookmark_border</span><!--[-->收藏文章<!--]--></div></button><!--]--></div><span></span><!--]--><a href="https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=ctinews.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="base-action-preferred-source md:ml-5" title="新增至偏好來源" aria-label="新增至偏好來源" data-v-9f7e13a7><img src="https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg_gradient/v1/24px.svg" class="logo" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" loading="eager" decoding="async"><span class="label">新增至偏好來源</span></a></div><div class="hidden md:flex" data-v-9f7e13a7><a href="https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=ctinews.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="base-action-preferred-source" title="新增至偏好來源" aria-label="新增至偏好來源" data-v-9f7e13a7><img src="https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/productlogos/googleg_gradient/v1/24px.svg" class="logo" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" loading="eager" decoding="async"><span class="label">新增至偏好來源</span></a></div><div class="article-info flex gap-5 justify-between" data-v-9f7e13a7><div class="flex flex-wrap mt-3 md:mt-0 md:items-center em:text-lg md:text-sm leading-relaxed" data-v-9f7e13a7><span class="text-gray-400 mr-2" data-v-9f7e13a7> 發布: <a href="https://ctinews.com/dates/2026-01-16" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="hover:underline" data-v-9f7e13a7><time datetime="2026-01-16T18:17:39+08:00" data-v-9f7e13a7>2026/01/16 18:17</time></a></span><span class="text-gray-400 mr-2" data-v-9f7e13a7> , 更新: <time datetime="2026-01-16T18:28:01+08:00" data-v-9f7e13a7>2026/01/16 18:28</time></span><span data-v-9f7e13a7> By <a href="/author/%E9%BB%83%E5%BD%A5%E6%98%87" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="text-primary hover:underline cti-author-name" data-v-9f7e13a7>黃彥昇</a></span></div></div><div class="row-start-2 col-start-1 col-span-3 flex items-center" data-v-9f7e13a7> 分享： <span data-v-9f7e13a7></span></div></div><div class="reading" data-v-9f7e13a7><span data-v-9f7e13a7></span></div></header><main itemprop="articleBody" class="article__main em:text-xl md:text-lg pt-5 md:pt-0 leading-normal relative" style="" data-v-9f7e13a7><div class="article-content" data-v-9f7e13a7><div class="rendered-content em:text-xl leading-normal ck-content bg-[#f7f8fd] relative py-1" lazy-load="true" loading-strategy="intersection-observer" data-v-9f7e13a7><p>民進黨彰化縣黨部於18日下午5點截止登記，今（16）日彰化政壇傳出世代交替消息。連任五屆的資深民進黨籍縣議員賴清美確定不參與此次選戰，正式宣布將由兒子曾煥燁接棒傳承。賴清美感性表示，兒子長期在旁見證服務過程，決心延續使命，未來將由這位具備農學專業背景與豐富公部門歷練的新生代投入選舉，期盼獲得鄉親認同。</p><div class="show-in-md">
          <div id="div-gpt-ad-1667796770316-0" class="ad-container ad-items" style="min-height: 250px; margin: 15px;" data-id="div-gpt-ad-1667796770316-0" data-minsize="300,250" data-size0="fluid" data-size1="300,250" data-size2="320,100" data-path="/32672392/22_CtiNews_Mobile/22C_Mobile_CP_TopBanner"></div>
        </div><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1536/2048;" width="1536" height="2048" alt="民進黨5連霸彰化縣議員賴清美宣布交棒給兒子曾煥燁。（圖／賴清美臉書）" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" src="/_ipx/w_1080&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768556809-wqrhkLb.jpg" data-original-src="https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768556809-wqrhkLb.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.removeAttribute('srcset');this.removeAttribute('sizes');this.src=this.getAttribute('data-original-src')" srcset="/_ipx/w_480&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768556809-wqrhkLb.jpg 480w, /_ipx/w_768&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768556809-wqrhkLb.jpg 768w, /_ipx/w_1080&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768556809-wqrhkLb.jpg 1080w, /_ipx/w_1440&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768556809-wqrhkLb.jpg 1440w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) calc(100vw - 420px), 1066px"><figcaption>民進黨5連霸彰化縣議員賴清美宣布交棒給兒子曾煥燁。（圖／賴清美臉書）</figcaption></figure><p>賴清美提及一段與兒子出生緊密相連的往事。民國77年5月20日台灣發生解嚴後首次大規模農民抗爭，數千農民因不滿農產品進口政策北上與警方爆發衝突。當時身懷六甲的她本欲前往聲援，雖被勸阻未成行，卻在事件隔日凌晨產下曾煥燁。這段歷史巧合不僅見證她關懷農運的初心，也成為母子間獨特的生命印記。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:960/1179;" src="https://scontent.ftpe4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/599952271_25990927480565969_5279333999716445828_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=109&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=hZaF7GwhmhsQ7kNvwE8AOhx&amp;_nc_oc=AdmzcajsNB7oGP0nhGtkAZfI2SCMxkFo0MuTl3XLEif8bqVebV2RbMqDS1mPfwXAGGY&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.ftpe4-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=a3jHlAGGB9cPZQWktbC6gA&amp;oh=00_AfoIOd8po3CGyPKleesf1i6FX4cv-zQQ4dGIoCV1h4qB3w&amp;oe=696FC3B5" alt="可能是食物和文字的圖像" width="960" height="1179" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>賴清美基層實力雄厚。（圖／賴清美臉書）</figcaption></figure><p>曾煥燁學經歷背景完整，擁有國立屏東科技大學農學院森林系碩士及嘉義大學森林暨自然資源學系學士學位，學術根基深厚。在實務經驗上，除了長期擔任母親服務處特助，亦曾在彰化縣文化局、新聞處任職，並歷任文化部古蹟修復工程工地負責人及行政院公共工程委員會品管採購人員。此外，他也曾參與台中市議員林德宇競選團隊，兼具地方服務熱忱與中央行政視野。</p>
            <ul class="article-promote-items promote-items" style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0px;">
                <li>
                    <a href="https://ctinews.com/news/items/gzaemqDEam" target="_blank" class="flex items-center">
                        <span class="material-icons-round text-5xl mr-2 flex-shrink-0"> play_circle_outline </span>
                        <span>台美對等關稅定案15％　張麗善：最好結果但付出什麼代價？</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul><div class="show-in-md">
          <div id="div-gpt-ad-1667796806666-0" class="ad-container ad-items" style="min-height: 250px; margin: 15px;" data-id="div-gpt-ad-1667796806666-0" data-minsize="300,250" data-size0="1,1" data-size1="300,250" data-size2="320,480" data-path="/32672392/22_CtiNews_Mobile/22C_Mobile_CP_MiddleBanner"></div>
        </div><p>賴清美指出，兒子數十年來耳濡目染，已做好承擔責任的準備。她懇請線西、伸港地區的鄉親支持優秀年輕人，讓服務精神得以延續。賴清美過去曾任彰化縣議會第16至19屆議員、全國黨代表及黨團總召，基層實力紮實。此次交棒不僅是家族傳承，更象徵綠營政治新血輪的注入，為2026年彰化縣議員選戰帶來新氣象。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div></div></div><div data-v-9f7e13a7><span data-v-9f7e13a7></span><span data-v-9f7e13a7></span></div><ul class="promote-items mt-5 grid grid-flow-row gap-5 font-bold text-theme-2 em:text-xl md:text-lg leading-tight" data-v-9f7e13a7><!--[--><li data-v-9f7e13a7><a href="https://ctinews.com/news/items/vNWOoBZXWw" target="_blank" class="flex items-center" data-v-9f7e13a7><span class="material-icons-round text-5xl mr-2 flex-shrink-0" data-v-9f7e13a7> play_circle_outline </span><span class="mt-1" data-v-9f7e13a7>柯志恩握手賴瑞隆後吐真言：面對狼群我不再是淑女</span></a></li><li data-v-9f7e13a7><a href="https://ctinews.com/news/items/qXWQyBV7WR" target="_blank" class="flex items-center" data-v-9f7e13a7><span class="material-icons-round text-5xl mr-2 flex-shrink-0" data-v-9f7e13a7> play_circle_outline </span><span class="mt-1" data-v-9f7e13a7>堅持要先看細項！藍白再否決1.25兆國防特別預算</span></a></li><!--]--></ul></main><footer class="article__footer mt-10" data-v-9f7e13a7><!----><!----><div class="tags py-8 lg:py-5 border-t border-b border-gray-50 mt-5" data-v-9f7e13a7><div class="flex flex-row" data-v-9f7e13a7><p class="text-lg black flex-shrink-0 mt-1" data-v-9f7e13a7> 標籤： </p><div class="group flex flex-row flex-wrap items-center -m-1 text-base" data-v-9f7e13a7><!----><!--[--><a href="/tags/%E8%B3%B4%E6%B8%85%E7%BE%8E" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">賴清美</p></a><a href="/tags/%E6%9B%BE%E7%85%A5%E7%87%81" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">曾煥燁</p></a><a href="/tags/%E5%BD%B0%E5%8C%96%E7%B8%A3" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">彰化縣</p></a><a href="/tags/%E5%BD%B0%E5%8C%96%E7%B8%A3%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">彰化縣議員</p></a><a href="/tags/2026%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">2026選舉</p></a><a href="/tags/%E6%B0%91%E9%80%B2%E9%BB%A8" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">民進黨</p></a><!--]--></div></div></div><span data-v-9f7e13a7></span></footer></article><footer class="news-items__footer"><div class="ad-min-space" style="min-width:1px;min-height:250px;"><span></span></div><div id="taboola-slot" class="border-b border-gray-50 py-20 md:py-10"><div id="taboola-below-article-thumbnails" class="taboola-container" style="min-height:250px;"></div></div><div><div class="related-section border-b border-gray-50 py-10"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5 lg:mb-6"><h2 class="text-3xl">相關報導</h2><!----></div><div class="related-news"><!--[--><div class="base-card base-card-sm grid grid-flow-col theme-default with-image"><div class="base-card__image relative self-start"><div class="base-news-img" style="aspect-ratio:176 / 118;"><img onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" width="176" height="118" alt="彰化婦囤物成山！1年清4次又堆滿....議員直擊大鼠亂竄嚇歪" loading="eager" data-nuxt-img srcset="/_ipx/f_webp&amp;q_80&amp;fit_cover&amp;s_176x118/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1778119869-CPpWCG8.png 1x, /_ipx/f_webp&amp;q_80&amp;fit_cover&amp;s_352x236/https://storag